  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 103.37 Landfill",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 103.37 “Landfill” means a facility which collects and disposes of waste by landfilling methods. The term includes facilities that collect and store waste indefinitely. The term does not include incinerators, land application sites, surface impoundments, and injection wells.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100) #8460-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #14103, effective 10-23-24 (formerly Env-Sw 103.32) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
